{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"5eb1721ee711d86f","type":"text","text":"Salah","x":-160,"y":-50,"width":250,"height":50},
		{"id":"fb8d47a94a7f1856","type":"text","text":"Music","x":-1420,"y":390,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"47e53ae1443b661b","type":"text","text":"Pets","x":-1460,"y":-25,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"bf60cff7c6930bf4","type":"text","text":"Learning","x":-1460,"y":-323,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"daf909dc185e52f7","type":"text","text":"Wisdom","x":-960,"y":-740,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"c3aa21737c0fad69","type":"text","text":"Video Games","x":-501,"y":-920,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"27bac89985069a2d","type":"text","text":"Philosophy","x":470,"y":-890,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"133f4db71f9e0096","type":"text","text":"Food","x":1000,"y":-710,"width":250,"height":50},
		{"id":"49650c39d9bca5dc","type":"text","text":"Career","x":1125,"y":-186,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d5bdbd7c991e00b4","type":"text","text":"Travel/Discovery","x":1125,"y":140,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"54b14aaf002127f4","type":"text","text":"Home","x":1000,"y":474,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6cc95a72f1ff4af3","type":"text","text":"Authenticity","x":440,"y":760,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0d3b0a14b06f1b24","type":"text","text":"Mass","x":-353,"y":860,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a18c1bd61181fcfe","type":"text","text":"Faith","x":-1295,"y":800,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"81a3eb36546511e2","type":"text","text":"Family","x":220,"y":-1020,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"b857dc59de1e18d2","type":"text","text":"Statistics/Data","x":-200,"y":-1280,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"acffe4316572d210","type":"text","text":"Wife","x":-856,"y":-1065,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ac4a8ec34501f6e8","type":"text","text":"I will be adept at understanding statistical principles, offering this to a company as a data scientist or something similar.","x":-251,"y":-1600,"width":340,"height":180},
		{"id":"d1f14a5c6d732359","type":"text","text":"My wife and I will have gotten closer and better at handling disagreements. We would have gotten closer in our faith and identities and careers to have a family.","x":-875,"y":-1298,"width":269,"height":178},
		{"id":"c928f89c70133383","type":"text","text":"I will be much more wise than I am now. But humble, of course.","x":-1377,"y":-1005,"width":417,"height":159},
		{"id":"9b590411f489a171","type":"text","text":"I'll be vastly more knowledgeable, like an encyclopedia of sorts. ","x":-1940,"y":-371,"width":333,"height":156},
		{"id":"35ae6df5cd162c82","type":"text","text":"I would have another cat, a dog, maybe some birds!","x":-2043,"y":-133,"width":436,"height":138},
		{"id":"0d1a6ebfaf880bfa","type":"text","text":"I'll have my own piano and be more accustomed to my favorite genres, seeing my favorite artists play live.","x":-2049,"y":282,"width":389,"height":168},
		{"id":"57b5260777eea226","type":"text","text":"I will be so much closer to God through my journey in life.","x":-1361,"y":1027,"width":381,"height":133},
		{"id":"0bac49b98f8ce871","type":"text","text":"I'll understand the Nicene creed by heart, as well as other things I need to know how to recite. I'll be accustomed to other traditions and rites.","x":-365,"y":1006,"width":325,"height":194},
		{"id":"66d474708bda70d3","type":"text","text":"I will be my best self, unapologetically so. Others will even probably be jealous or hateful!","x":573,"y":943,"width":307,"height":160},
		{"id":"a07db160d6b2ef79","type":"text","text":"We will have an amazing home, close to the beach or something.","x":1078,"y":596,"width":297,"height":124},
		{"id":"fb511c4b5f8e73d4","type":"text","text":"At this point I would have traveled to many places, and seen many things.","x":1600,"y":125,"width":280,"height":95},
		{"id":"a676424dc8c7f3bf","type":"text","text":"Well...I gotta survive","x":1093,"y":-957,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8f2a4dff35281595","type":"text","text":"I'll be still vested in philosophy even after my Ph.D., learning how to embrace the difficulties of life with it.","x":700,"y":-1220,"width":339,"height":173},
		{"id":"420682297fdd736a","type":"text","text":"I will have a loving family with girls and boys in San Diego.","x":214,"y":-1411,"width":286,"height":113},
		{"id":"d0e18302b3b7838c","type":"text","text":"I'll have a grown library of video games to share with others and I know what I love to play over time.","x":-710,"y":-1560,"width":359,"height":140},
		{"id":"c4f9f0821c36c48f","type":"text","text":"I'll be a senior in my career, being seen as a very skilled problem solver and I will be paid well for my education and skills.","x":1520,"y":-219,"width":340,"height":126}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"cbb49e9ec85dba57","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"left","toNode":"daf909dc185e52f7","toSide":"bottom","label":"I cultivate wisdom by learning how to be better and more humble."},
		{"id":"746b2ce28dd2d76a","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"left","toNode":"c3aa21737c0fad69","toSide":"bottom","label":"I play video games almost daily."},
		{"id":"f08d938b9887b8d6","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"top","toNode":"81a3eb36546511e2","toSide":"bottom","label":"I visit my parents at least once a year."},
		{"id":"10a6dc526c593f6c","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"top","toNode":"27bac89985069a2d","toSide":"bottom","label":"Being logically rigorous is important, I attend PACS, read literature, etc."},
		{"id":"96ceaaa322a88a83","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"top","toNode":"133f4db71f9e0096","toSide":"bottom","label":"I eat out with Sara and we enjoy it a lot. I also love spending time eating home cooked meals."},
		{"id":"0b00cc5ebc8852f6","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"right","toNode":"49650c39d9bca5dc","toSide":"left","label":"Attempting to discover what I am meant for, after graduate school."},
		{"id":"742de3e19ff11af0","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"right","toNode":"d5bdbd7c991e00b4","toSide":"left","label":"Thinking of traveling, going every few months somewhere."},
		{"id":"36b351b05cbb1a5a","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"54b14aaf002127f4","toSide":"top","label":"I spend a lot of time home, and investing in furniture and other things for the home."},
		{"id":"b006f85187582455","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a18c1bd61181fcfe","toSide":"top","label":"I try to remember Jesus daily in all my heart when things are hard and when I am grateful for the good things in life."},
		{"id":"4ae07f6bf2574b1e","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"left","toNode":"fb8d47a94a7f1856","toSide":"right","label":"In the past I've played piano which I would like to continue, but I have lately been using music to help me focus with work."},
		{"id":"e69e353a5f389245","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"left","toNode":"47e53ae1443b661b","toSide":"right","label":"I spend time feeding Athena, petting her and playing with her."},
		{"id":"8b94c855433bf73d","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"left","toNode":"bf60cff7c6930bf4","toSide":"right","label":"I learn new things for skills, ideas. I spend lots of time on Wikipedia and I try to watch YouTube and I read books a lot."},
		{"id":"145e7e46f1d20d3c","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"6cc95a72f1ff4af3","toSide":"top","label":"It is important that I be my true self, not performing for others. I have been bothered and I speak out when something is not right for me. I make my own decisions lately."},
		{"id":"3c60d7fa9cec8404","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"top","toNode":"b857dc59de1e18d2","toSide":"bottom","label":"I haven't cultivated this a lot but I love the idea of data and the structure of the world and grasping portiosn of it. I have studied some of this."},
		{"id":"bcb3c71f86b263b3","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"0d3b0a14b06f1b24","toSide":"top","label":"I go to Mass every Sunday, and I go to confession when its needed."},
		{"id":"b619650fc0670c5a","fromNode":"5eb1721ee711d86f","fromSide":"top","toNode":"acffe4316572d210","toSide":"bottom","label":"I spend nearly every day with Sara, I also take her out about weekly."},
		{"id":"ae0e5928e5e41e87","fromNode":"b857dc59de1e18d2","fromSide":"top","toNode":"ac4a8ec34501f6e8","toSide":"bottom"},
